# CRITICAL DEVELOPMENT RULE

Do not simply generate code based on this prompt.

**Inspect the existing AxonTimeHR codebase first.**

Preserve Phase 1 and Phase 2 architecture.

Reuse existing:

* models
* authentication
* JWT handling
* RBAC
* tenant context
* database session
* configuration
* exception handling
* logging
* testing utilities
* frontend components
* design system

Only introduce new architecture when necessary.

The goal is not just to make Phase 3 work.

The goal is to build a **production-grade HRMS foundation that can safely support the future Attendance, Leave, Shift, Payroll, Reporting, Mobile and SaaS modules.**

Do not take shortcuts that will create technical debt for later phases.

This Phase 3 is deliberately focused on **Organization + Employee Master Data**, because those entities should exist before building the attendance/shift/leave engines that depend on them.
